fire is still alive.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:37.912
- Yes.

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:38.745
- The fire is still alive

00:00:38.745 --> 00:00:40.020
and it was an awkward way to meet someone.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.700
